[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0010","text":"哇……这一页也有路加酱呢～……！\n好帅啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0020","text":"表情和姿势都不愧是路加呢\n拍摄肯定一下子就搞定了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0030","text":"诶……是这样吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0040","text":"我总是不知该怎么做才好……\n手忙脚乱的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0060","text":"…………干嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0070","text":"路加酱，拍摄的时候\n是怎么做的呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0080","text":"…………得做准备\n多少做一点……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0090","text":"做准备啊……\n拍摄之前先模拟一下──之类的……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0100","text":"对啊……！\n羽那，我们一起想想吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600100_01_0102","text":"Motion"}]
